<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n42801" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">scăbĭōsus</span></b> ,
			a, um, adj.
		id. (post-Aug.). <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Rough</i>, <i>scurfy</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">coralium,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					32, 2, 11, § 22</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">far,</span>”
				<i>old</i>, <i>spoiled</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Pers.
					5, 74</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Scabby</i>, <i>mangy</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">boves, Col.11,2,83: (homo),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Pers.
					2, 13</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">anguli (oculorum),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					29, 2, 10, § 36</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">macies mulorum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">App. M. 9, p. 223</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
